{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:5ec2077248e5126d","name":"Force Adept Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-5ec2077248e5126d","title":"Force Adept Talent Tree","revision":18180,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T19:43:31Z","sha256":"3a9b1f535709e34ab49e1b033f7daa1d116ee966ec24ed6c9b044cc3542c92ad","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18180","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Force%20Adept%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-5ec2077248e5126d","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Force Adepts"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Adepts"}," use ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"}," to survive on fringe worlds, and they often have signature ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Powers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Powers","referenceId":"reference:85acec94cd1ca5f3"}," that they use particularly well.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Force Power Adept"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["You are skilled at using a particular ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"},". Select one ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"}," you know. When using that ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"},", you have the option of spending a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," to make two ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," checks, keeping the better result. This Talent may be selected multiple times. Its effects do not stack. Each time you select this Talent, you must choose a different ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Force Treatment"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["You can make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check in place of a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Treat Injury"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Treat_Injury","referenceId":"reference:f1b9875c2302ce61"}," check. You are considered ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Treat Injury"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Treat_Injury","referenceId":"reference:f1b9875c2302ce61"}," skill. If you are entitled to a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Treat Injury"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Treat_Injury","referenceId":"reference:f1b9875c2302ce61"}," check reroll, you may reroll your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check instead (subject to the same circumstances and limitations). In addition, you can administer ",{"tag":"a","children":["First Aid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/First_Aid"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Treat Disease"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Treat_Disease"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Treat Poison"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Treat_Poison"},", and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Treat Radiation"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Treat_Radiation"}," without the requisite ",{"tag":"a","children":["Medical Kit"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Medical_Kit","referenceId":"reference:6880b06746719e0b"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Medpac"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Medpac","referenceId":"reference:f89e0de3ab0ae989"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Fortified Body"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Equilibrium"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equilibrium"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"}," shields you against ailments, toxins, and radiation poisoning, making you immune to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Disease"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Disease"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Poison"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Poison"},", and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Radiation"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Radiation","referenceId":"reference:669c428e617d7f09"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Additional Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Instrument of the Force"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unknown Regions Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unknown_Regions_Campaign_Guide"}]}," \n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You are particularly in tune with ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Living Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Living_Force"},". When you successfully use ",{"tag":"a","children":["Search Your Feelings"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Search_Your_Feelings"},", you gain a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," that must be used before the end of the encounter.  If you use this ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," in a manner that would end in unfavorable results (per ",{"tag":"a","children":["Search Your Feelings"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Search_Your_Feelings"},"), you raise your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Side Score"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Side_Score"}," by 1. If you use the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," in an action that would normally raise your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Side Score"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Side_Score"},", you raise your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Side Score"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Side_Score"}," by 2 instead. \n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Long Call"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unknown Regions Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unknown_Regions_Campaign_Guide"}]}," \n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Mystical Link"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When using the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Telepathy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Telepathy"}," ability of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"},", you reduce the DC of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check by half, as do those Force-users for whom you are a willing telepathic recipient. When attempting to contact an unwilling target, you can reroll and take the better result.  By spending a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"},", you can simultaneously contact a number of targets equal to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Charisma"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Charisma"}," modifier (minimum two) with a single ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check. \n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Mystical Link"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unknown Regions Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unknown_Regions_Campaign_Guide"}]}," \n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"}," guides you in unexpected ways. As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},", make a DC 30 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check. If the check is successful, you gain one of the following benefits, as selected by the Gamemaster: \n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":["One ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"}," is returned to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power Suite"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power_Suite"},"."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["Gain one ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," that is lost if it is not spent before the end of the encounter."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["Gain an additional use of a Force-related ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talent"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talent"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Feat"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Feat"}," normally restricted to once per encounter."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["Roll an additional die when making a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check and select the highest die rolled."]}]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
